1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,649
Ask an A.I. one simple question.

2
00:00:02,649 --> 00:00:04,761
Will it rain in my village tomorrow?

3
00:00:04,761 --> 00:00:08,637
Before it reads your question, the machine chops it into pieces.

4
00:00:08,637 --> 00:00:10,970
In English... just eight.

5
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,622
Now ask it in Hindi.

6
00:00:12,622 --> 00:00:16,354
On DeepSeek, the famous Chinese A.I.... eighteen.

7
00:00:16,354 --> 00:00:17,780
More than double.

8
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:19,621
Marathi, twenty.

9
00:00:19,621 --> 00:00:21,691
Telugu, twenty-five.

10
00:00:21,691 --> 00:00:25,454
And in those two, it even cuts some of our letters in half.

11
00:00:25,454 --> 00:00:28,392
So can India build an A.I. of its own?

12
00:00:28,392 --> 00:00:30,866
One that speaks our language best?

13
00:00:30,866 --> 00:00:32,110
Here's a clue for you.

14
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:33,557
Ask it in Chinese.

15
00:00:33,557 --> 00:00:34,845
Seven pieces.

16
00:00:34,845 --> 00:00:36,206
Fewer than English.

17
00:00:36,206 --> 00:00:37,539
You see what's going on?

18
00:00:37,539 --> 00:00:41,588
A machine speaks best in the language of the people who built it.

19
00:00:41,588 --> 00:00:43,056
And it's not just pride.

20
00:00:43,056 --> 00:00:45,856
Your apps pay these machines by the piece.

21
00:00:45,856 --> 00:00:50,269
More pieces means a bigger bill, and a slower answer for you.

22
00:00:50,269 --> 00:00:52,140
Now think back to last November.

23
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:57,177
Chat G.P.T.'s paid plan, called Go, became free in India for a whole year.

24
00:00:57,177 --> 00:00:58,739
Maybe you signed up too.

25
00:00:58,739 --> 00:01:02,474
OpenAI says India is now one of its biggest markets.

26
00:01:02,474 --> 00:01:07,285
For the first people who signed up, that free year runs out... about now.

27
00:01:07,285 --> 00:01:10,743
So when yours ends, whose machine will you be talking to?

28
00:01:10,743 --> 00:01:12,184
One built in America?

29
00:01:12,184 --> 00:01:13,540
One built in China?

30
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:15,234
Or one built here?

31
00:01:15,234 --> 00:01:20,169
To see why India doesn't have its own yet, you have to go back to one Monday.

32
00:01:20,169 --> 00:01:23,192
The twenty-seventh of January, twenty twenty-five.

33
00:01:23,192 --> 00:01:27,815
A small Chinese lab called DeepSeek has just put out a free A.I.

34
00:01:27,815 --> 00:01:33,360
By that Monday, it's beaten Chat G.P.T. in downloads on Apple's App Store in America.

